# GDPR Compliance Report
## Annual Review - 2025

### Executive Summary
NexaTech Solutions remains fully compliant with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) as of December 31, 2025.

### Data Processing Activities
- Customer data processed: 2,147 organizations
- Data subjects: Approximately 500,000 end users
- Data processing locations: US, EU, Singapore

### Key Compliance Measures
- Data Processing Agreements (DPAs) in place with all customers
- Privacy by Design principles integrated into product development
- Regular Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) conducted
- Data breach notification procedures established

### Data Subject Rights
- Access requests processed: 45
- Erasure requests processed: 12
- Portability requests processed: 8
- All requests completed within 30-day timeframe

### Training and Awareness
- 100% of employees completed GDPR training
- Quarterly refresher training conducted
- Privacy champions program established

